<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-National Australia to raise US$875 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-National Australia to raise US$875 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Ltd said on Friday it would raise US$875 million from a global offering of exchangeable capital units, up from the planned US$750 million raising announced in November 1996.</p>
</text>
